========================================================================

  All computable to any n via cycle-index algebra:

  1. V(n) = A000568 (tournament iso classes):
     [2, 4, 12, 56, 456, 6880, 191536, 9733056, 903753248, 154108311168, 48542114686912]

  2. SC(n) (self-complementary classes):
     [2, 2, 8, 12, 88, 176, 2752, 8784, 279968, 1492288, 95458560]

  3. T(n) (total arc-orbits):
     [4, 16, 88, 704, 8912, 188288, 6847200, 437069312, 49674860096, 10169189235712, 3786065734484352]

  4. V_merged(n) = (V + SC) / 2:
     [2, 3, 10, 34, 272, 3528, 97144, 4870920, 452016608, 77054901728, 24271105072736]

  5. T_merged(n) = (T + T_anti) / 2:
